<rml>
<head>
    <title>S2x Launcher</title>
    <link type="text/rcss" href="launcher.rcss" />
</head>
<body>
    <div class="main-container">
        <div class="nav">
            <button id="nav-play" class="nav-link active" action="menu:play">Play</button>
            <button id="nav-profiles" class="nav-link" action="menu:profiles">Profiles</button>
            <button id="nav-options" class="nav-link" action="menu:options">Options</button>
            <button id="nav-about" class="nav-link" action="menu:about">About</button>
        </div>

        <div class="menus">
            <div id="menu-play" class="panel active">
                <div class="cards">
                    <button id="singleplayer" class="card" action="play:singleplayer">
                        <img src="singleplayer.png" />
                        <div class="card-content"><span>Singleplayer</span><div class="card-action">Play</div></div>
                    </button>
                    <button id="multiplayer" class="card" action="play:multiplayer">
                        <img src="multiplayer.png" />
                        <div class="card-content"><span>Multiplayer</span><div class="card-action">Play</div></div>
                    </button>
                    <button id="zombies" class="card" action="play:zombies">
                        <img src="zombies.png" />
                        <div class="card-content"><span>Zombies</span><div class="card-action">Play</div></div>
                    </button>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div id="menu-profiles" class="panel">
                <div class="option-row">
                    <div class="option-text">
                        <div class="option-title">Player profile</div>
                        <div id="profile-description" class="option-desc">Choose who's playing.</div>
                        <div id="profile-error" class="profile-error"></div>
                    </div>
                    <div id="profile-mode" class="dropdown">
                        <button id="profile-button" class="dropdown-button" action="dropdown">
                            <span id="profile-label">Default</span><span class="arrow"></span>
                        </button>
                        <div id="profile-list" class="dropdown-list"></div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="option-row">
                    <div class="option-text">
                        <div class="option-title">Create profile</div>
                        <div class="option-desc">Start with your own Multiplayer and Zombies progress.</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="profile-create">
                        <div class="profile-input-row">
                            <input id="profile-name" type="text" placeholder="Profile name" maxlength="32" />
                            <button id="create-profile" action="create-profile">Create</button>
                        </div>
                        <div id="create-profile-error" class="profile-error"></div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div id="menu-options" class="panel">
                <div class="option-row">
                    <div class="option-text">
                        <div class="option-title">Console type</div>
                        <div class="option-desc">Console used for game output and commands.</div>
                    </div>
                    <div id="console-mode" class="dropdown">
                        <button id="console-button" class="dropdown-button" action="dropdown">
                            <span id="console-label">S2x console (default)</span><span class="arrow"></span>
                        </button>
                        <div class="dropdown-list">
                            <button id="console-syscon" class="dropdown-item" action="console:syscon">S2x console (default)</button>
                            <button id="console-terminal" class="dropdown-item" action="console:terminal">Enhanced terminal</button>
                            <button id="console-disabled" class="dropdown-item" action="console:disabled">No console</button>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <button id="no-steam" class="option-row" action="toggle-steam">
                    <div class="option-text">
                        <div class="option-title">Launch without Steam</div>
                        <div class="option-desc">Start S2x without initializing Steam integration.</div>
                    </div>
                    <span class="switch"><span class="switch-knob"></span></span>
                </button>
                <button id="no-update" class="option-row" action="toggle-update">
                    <div class="option-text">
                        <div class="option-title">Disable automatic updates</div>
                        <div class="option-desc">Skip the update check at startup. Manual updates become your responsibility.</div>
                    </div>
                    <span class="switch"><span class="switch-knob"></span></span>
                </button>
            </div>

            <div id="menu-about" class="panel">
                <div class="about">
                    <img class="about-logo" alt="S2x" src="wordmark.png" />
                    <p class="links">
                        <button action="github">GitHub</button>
                        <button action="discord">Discord</button>
                    </p>
                    <p>S2x is a custom client for Call of Duty&#174;: WWII, created as an independent community project.
                        This project is provided for personal and educational use. Please use it responsibly.</p>
                    <p>S2x does not condone piracy or the unauthorized distribution of game files.
                        You must own a legitimate Steam copy of Call of Duty&#174;: WWII in order to use this client.</p>
                    <p>S2x is not affiliated with, endorsed by, or sponsored by Activision, Sledgehammer Games,
                        Call of Duty, or any related publishers, developers, or trademark holders. Call of Duty&#174;
                        and Call of Duty&#174;: WWII are trademarks of their respective owners.</p>
                    <p>The name S2x is a homage to the former X Labs projects and their work in the Call of Duty
                        modding community. S2x is not affiliated with X Labs, and any references are made out of
                        respect for their influence on this project.</p>
                    <p><button id="licenses-button" class="text-link" action="menu:licenses">Licenses and notices</button></p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div id="menu-licenses" class="panel">
                <button class="text-link" action="menu:about">Back to About</button>
                <div id="licenses-text"></div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</rml>
